          "Qur'an 19:53 (Allah granted Harun prophethood as a mercy for Musa)",
          "Qur'an 26:12-15 (Musa asks his Lord to send Harun to him, because his brother's tongue is more free in speech)",
          "Qur'an 28:34-35 (Harun is more eloquent in speech; Allah makes him a helper and strengthens the hand of Musa)",
          "Qur'an 7:150 (Musa returns to his people and the scene with his brother)",
